Internet Services

A Plug-In for Mill. Put it in the "Mill Plug-Ins" folder. Take out the Finger
example if it's there: both give finger:.

  ftp://host/path            File Transfer Protocol (RFC 959)
  gopher://host/             Gopher (RFC 1436)
  finger://host/user         Finger (RFC 1288)
  whois://host/query         Whois (RFC 3912)
  dict://host/d:word         Dictionary Server Protocol (RFC 2229); m:word for matches
  time://host/               Time Protocol (RFC 868)

plugin://internet/about has a form for each, filled in from Settings.

"Set this Mac's clock" adds the difference shown to the Mac's time when it is
clicked. The time zone is the Map control panel's.

Build: ./build.sh writes build/Internet Services.bin.
